*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Grozziie TP732H 80 mm thermal label printer through the rastertoprinter filter
*% (host/cups_filter.c, the firmware's driver). See tools/cups/README.md.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "TP732H.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Grozziie"
*Product: "(TP732H)"
*ModelName: "Grozziie TP732H label printer"
*ShortNickName: "TP732H"
*NickName: "Grozziie TP732H label printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.tp732h 0 rastertoprinter"

*% 8-bit sGray (cupsColorSpace 18) at the printer's 203 dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 18>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w227h369
*PageSize w227h369/80 x 130 mm: "<</PageSize[227 369]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w227h369
*PageRegion w227h369/80 x 130 mm: "<</PageSize[227 369]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w227h369
*ImageableArea w227h369: "0 0 227 369"
*DefaultPaperDimension: w227h369
*PaperDimension w227h369: "227 369"
